  "timeline": [
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The water department is seeking a Maui room, such as the planning conference room, for some hearings.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:22:50",
        "endTs": "0:23:24",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The chair said she would put the site-visit question on the agenda for the next meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:22:32",
        "endTs": "0:23:02",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The chair said whether to ask for a board member on the site visit will go on the next agenda.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:22:24",
        "endTs": "0:22:54",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The county attorney said a special meeting in early January could be held to share the witness summary.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:19:06",
        "endTs": "0:19:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "She offered to summarize witnesses and issues, possibly at the board's December meeting.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:18:17",
        "endTs": "0:19:11",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "She said no estimate has been given for when a recommendation will reach the board.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:16:24",
        "endTs": "0:16:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "No deadline is set yet for written testimony; the county attorney guessed end of November or December.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:16:03",
        "endTs": "0:16:33",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "Written witness statements will be filed with the board, and everyone will be able to see them.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:14:41",
        "endTs": "0:15:11",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "She said main issues include how much water is requested, county water needs, Native Hawaiian uses, and fire protection.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:10:23",
        "endTs": "0:11:17",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "Main witness testimony will be filed in writing as sworn statements, then tested by cross-examination.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:09:40",
        "endTs": "0:10:13",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "Named witnesses may not watch the hearings before they testify.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:08:10",
        "endTs": "0:08:42",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The county attorney said she will share hearing dates with everyone once she has them.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:08:02",
        "endTs": "0:08:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "The hearing officer ruled the hearings will be open to the public in person, as space allows, but not livestreamed.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:07:14",
        "endTs": "0:07:44",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "All November and December dates are canceled, except a possible site visit not yet scheduled.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:06:40",
        "endTs": "0:07:10",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-10-16",
      "text": "A county attorney for the Department of Water Supply updated the board on East Maui Irrigation's contested case (a court-like hearing).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "8aasYotZcMM",
        "ts": "0:03:46",
        "endTs": "0:05:01",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-11-04T07:35:01.983Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Authority"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The director was asked to look into a short online special meeting for a contested case update after October 1.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:52:18",
        "endTs": "0:53:12",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Hearings are estimated at 15 days, with a result hoped for by the end of the year.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:49:22",
        "endTs": "0:50:06",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Witness testimony will be submitted in writing, and witnesses will then face cross-examination (questions from other parties).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:44:53",
        "endTs": "0:45:42",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Open questions, including where hearings are held and whether they are streamed, will be decided after an October 1 prehearing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:39:15",
        "endTs": "0:40:06",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The county attorney will update the board after the October 1 prehearing.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:39:02",
        "endTs": "0:39:32",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The permit applicants carry the burden to show how much water they need.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:37:46",
        "endTs": "0:38:27",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "The attorney said the case is only about the 2026 and 2027 permits, not the long-term license.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:35:03",
        "endTs": "0:35:40",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Hearings are planned for Oʻahu, not Maui, but that is not yet decided.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:23:05",
        "endTs": "0:23:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "A prehearing is set for October 1, with hearings November 4 and 5.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:22:30",
        "endTs": "0:23:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "On September 11, the operator's attorney appealed the denial of its contested case request in circuit court.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:09:48",
        "endTs": "0:10:18",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-09-18",
      "text": "Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) rejected the operator's request for a contested case (a trial-like hearing) after an executive session (a closed-door discussion).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "jggU3kzKFQI",
        "ts": "0:09:16",
        "endTs": "0:09:53",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:03:54.314Z"
      },
      "body": "ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-20",
      "text": "Mahi Pono may appeal the denial of its contested case request in court within a set number of days.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:10:26",
        "endTs": "0:10:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-20",
      "text": "The contested case process on the revocable permits will now start.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:10:15",
        "endTs": "0:10:45",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-20",
      "text": "Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) unanimously let its chair appoint a hearings officer to start that contested case for 2026 and 2027 permits.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:09:55",
        "endTs": "0:10:30",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-20",
      "text": "About a month ago, a judge ordered Board of Land and Natural Resources (BLNR) to hold a contested case on the revocable permits.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:09:28",
        "endTs": "0:09:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-08-20",
      "text": "A community member withdrew a contested case request (a formal, trial-like hearing) so the board could vote.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "9vFQege7xis",
        "ts": "0:04:49",
        "endTs": "0:05:28",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-07T23:26:09.917Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Regional Community Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-17",
      "text": "An environmental court judge heard arguments on an appeal over an earlier permit and said a decision would come soon.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "oDSa7vE18b8",
        "ts": "0:26:42",
        "endTs": "0:27:33",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:04.288Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Board"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-07-17",
      "text": "The vice chair said the state land board will have to issue at least one more revocable permit (a short-term permit that can be cancelled).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "oDSa7vE18b8",
        "ts": "0:25:42",
        "endTs": "0:26:20",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-09T06:35:04.288Z"
      },
      "body": "East Maui Water Board"
    }
  ],
