    "note": "The State Board of Land and Natural Resources (the Land Board), not the County, decides these permits. A court ordered a contested case on the 2026 and 2027 permits, which works like a trial: witness testimony is submitted in writing and witnesses are cross-examined. As of the Sept. 18 ʻAha Moku o Maui Hikina meeting, hearings were set for Nov. 4 and 5; they have since been postponed to Jan. 19, 2027. Check the Land Board for the current schedule.",
